From: Dmitry Romanov <romanovda@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:53:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ZDC try X1: the offline Lambda chain built into EICrecon

Phase 4 (the Lambda bar fight), experiment X1_offline_chain, build label X1.
- R1 clustering (PR 3064) with neighbourLayersRange 1 (P1d)
- P1d's calibration refit on the D2/D3 guns: photon 3.901*E^0.876, neutron 8.064*E^0.700
- LambdaReconstruction: every photon pair with every neutron through the vertex fit, ranked by the
  fitted pi0 and Lambda masses (PR 3063, R3); the stable vertex by bisection along the momentum-weighted
  slope (B9d); the neutron at its reference point, the leader cluster (B9e)
Prediction: S4a_tm per thrown Lambda -> n pi0 = 1.5 % mean over 100-275 GeV and 3.0 % at 275 GeV
(R1's offline vertex_fixed tagrefit 1.64 % / 3.07 %; the in-chain pairing loses the events where truth
picked the triplet offline). Judged against R1_pr3064 (0.404 % / 0.832 %).
Verdict: pending (recorded in the next commit on this branch).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
